{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:34 2026-11-19 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"TVB台慶2026丨羅嘉良驚喜重返TVB  獻唱〈奇哥〉超經典  汪明荃再見撈家互動真摯\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0aedf4515e5d7b65ee00d034d276e557/2026-11/2026_2_.png\"/>\n<p>TVB台慶2026丨無綫集團年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶》於今晚11月19日（星期四）在將軍澳電視廣播城隆重舉行，慶祝TVB 59周年。久未回巢的三屆視帝羅嘉良，穿上一襲白色型格西裝外套，以及太陽眼鏡，於亮光儀式後，率領全台逾200位藝人打頭陣演出。</p>\n<h2>羅嘉良炒熱氣氛</h2>\n<p>羅嘉良一登場便勾起全場高呼，獻唱其經典代表作〈奇哥〉及〈難兄難弟〉，歌聲一出，瞬間將氣氛推向頂峰，逾200位藝員包括關嘉敏、陳楨怡、游嘉欣、劉佩玥、周嘉洛、林夏薇、高海寧、陳豪、馬國明、譚俊彥、羅子溢等分批出場，跟著羅嘉良演出起舞，場面壯觀。</p>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良相隔多年再在台慶演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/32f9df848ea825af981b6f2f6a2a50d7/2026-11/_dsc1313.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良演出打頭陣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/30aed35bfe5b1ea69307fd0bf2646a1c/2026-11/_dsc1334.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良率領全台藝人演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ec1f72812a074ff160412a2e644e9281/2026-11/_dsc1339.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良身穿一襲白色型格西裝外套登場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0cba90d20ac0aee088c539563f78b024/2026-11/_dsc1379.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良獻唱其經典代表作〈奇哥〉及〈難兄難弟〉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5e4b6c138c9e2aa8681b7554e1f18dd4/2026-11/_dsc1344.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良與羅天宇、蔡潔、戴祖儀、黃庭鋒、吳偉豪、關嘉敏、陳楨怡、游嘉欣等合作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/95dfb02cf18cb145fd301e742c475864/2026-11/_dsc1352.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良獲大批藝人伴舞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5e64a1fcd29004b8b8e72b9c8fc76ba7/2026-11/_dsc1355.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良演出精彩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c62ba47fb1904cb49c3bcf0fad788950/2026-11/_dsc1364.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良再打造經典。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6de7fbc3d8c12fad715c7706f9d10962/2026-11/_dsc1373.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良將氣氛推向頂峰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3d63717cbb28465e75567261b971543f/2026-11/_dsc1374.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良炒熱氣氛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/93d1144ad405e8072fd3693fee49988f/2026-11/_dsc1376.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張振朗、劉佩玥、周嘉洛、朱敏瀚、劉穎鏇、阮浩棕等登場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c61654f8e862906ab3b43f1cce2eba48/2026-11/_dsc1410.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉佩玥與周嘉洛好投入。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2aff602a7c086b52aea984dca5ba7140/2026-11/_dsc1412.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"好好傾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/74c1d5a57ebe581797ee17aa21f97b98/2026-11/_dsc1413.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"眾人好似開派對。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cf1145b31b795812863f9e60cbc89595/2026-11/_dsc1415.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曉華、阮浩棕、郭柏妍等表演。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a7265e8580a6b48a86475466454a2352/2026-11/_dsc1421.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曉華、阮浩棕、郭柏妍、馬貫東演出投入。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3c7bb364bd0469302c3ea44ebd7c5173/2026-11/_dsc1422.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樊亦敏、車婉婉、朱敏瀚等。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c9044f2417773b11ef545cec208d9aa0/2026-11/_dsc1426.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張振朗、劉穎鏇、劉佩玥等表演。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a6092b1c6154979dc86d772ddd126c11/2026-11/_dsc1434.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"全台逾200藝人演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f81847a5f63220b2194ff3d6dd76ff36/2026-11/_dsc1431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪、高海寧\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/440ca1623f60491d2ce5e59a620af1d0/2026-11/TVB_law_38_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張曦雯、馬國明\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f9df5880a965f242e2242df8708e0a87/2026-11/TVB_law_42_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳煒、譚俊彥\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/54db9309551936247c3f7aea2da7ee0d/2026-11/TVB_law_43_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林夏薇、陳展鵬\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7757e2fa63cc8ebfaf7cf5929402a23a/2026-11/TVB_law_46_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅子溢、陳自瑤\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b1059f9b3698c259543138143f632063/2026-11/TVB_law_50_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚子羚、蕭正楠\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2200172112e0bf9f549a479925add994/2026-11/TVB_law_52_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"傅嘉莉、曹永廉\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4787a8ddbb67fdc95367a196e5e2eb84/2026-11/TVB_law_55_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳敏之、袁偉豪\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1923a7d02ea5b55a3f8ed8782741ca93/2026-11/TVB_law_58_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良大玩氣氛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/04cf66eef107ffc9d8c9e293b3ea9edd/2026-11/_dsc1442.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良演出順利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5f06c4d194f8b10ee7d64b5dbbb8ce05/2026-11/_dsc1439.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良與汪明荃聚舊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/93004e14f07474b93ef76e6e27b35e26/2026-11/_dsc1495.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"羅嘉良擔任抽獎嘉賓，抽出第一位幸運藝人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a16a0f3e52c5cef26b654c29188d5159/2026-11/_dsc1500.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃庭鋒成為羅嘉良抽出的幸運兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0ebecf5e2b8ec791181883960f98f647/2026-11/_dsc1503.jpg\"/>\n<h2>汪明荃羅嘉良聚舊</h2>\n<p>表演結束後，大會司儀「阿姐」汪明荃與羅嘉良溫馨相擁，二人久未碰面，汪明荃興奮地對羅嘉良說：「你好，好耐冇見啊！歡迎你返嚟TVB！」而羅嘉良亦顯得十分激動表示：「好開心啊！非常Happy！」汪明荃又為羅嘉良打氣，連聲說道：「好，加油！加油！」互動真摯。隨後，羅嘉良在全場歡呼下，為台慶抽出第一位幸運兒。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:58:12.582243+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":439,"images":34,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T12:34:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T13:51:37.288618+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:51:37.288618+00:00","content_hash":"a4a613639ce5fec59eb58b503b4d38185e3946f74cacd7bd450691232d3c604f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}